rmgk_gekko: the time spent waiting for remote input, as a running total

begin_frame spins while the prediction window is full. rmgk_gekko::total_wait_us() is the sum of
those waits, exact at every frame (the lag meter folds its own count into reports later), so the
front end can tell a frame the network held from one that was slow. Nothing else changes.

